{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_title", "source_sha256": "6bf5339ff61ed40ab6bc4c02503964283e44e0100e9f38f4df75662fc4aa2211", "ja": "問題！　自分らしさとは？", "zh": "提问！何谓自己的风格？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dd2a43e073266a5df4d95113e8d8c4eee819af4afd136424b657a22e576890fe", "ja": "定期公演で新曲のお披露目をする事になった\nのり子に、何か目標を決めてみたらどうだ？　\nと語るプロデューサー。クイズ番組の出演や\n新曲の公演を経て、のり子は自分なりの目標\nを決めるのだった。", "zh": "要在定期公演上公开新歌的法子，\n制作人对她说要不要定一个目标？\n在经历猜谜节目的演出和新歌公演后，\n法子定下了属于自己的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5f164137c870b909793c537a433aae12993f49e62f5c305106d49f94e89601f9", "ja": "（曲が終わり、大きな歓声が聞こえてくる。\nそして観客席には、たくさんの笑顔が溢れている……）", "zh": "（歌曲结束，响起了巨大的欢呼声。观众席上也洋溢着灿烂的笑容……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "c86bfba53d3070c9fcfec30d6bbb090b44406b43ad97ba8996d2083045c0dbf8", "ja": "ありがとーっ！　聞いてもらったのは\nアタシの曲で、『マイペース☆マイウェイ』でした！", "zh": "谢谢大家——！刚才大家听到的是\n我的歌曲，《My Pace☆My Way》！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "6642709349e1a16d85df831cbec061cb9755568ebf98a4d9837b87e13535423a", "ja": "『THE☆アイドルショー』のアタシ達を見て、\n劇場に来てくれたお客さんもいると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "来看演出的观众里，我想应该也有\n看了《THE☆偶像SHOW》的我们才来剧场的吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "a530a3f47e3fb99078648742a21de9091f4ae5811879e0cae537dc4b7494a193", "ja": "アタシと春香と瑞希が参加したクイズコーナー……\nすっごく熱かったと思わない！？", "zh": "我、春香，还有瑞希参加的猜谜环节……\n是不是特别热闹！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1004_audience", "source_sha256": "59b4beeeffdcb6ae11224e02c0358f7d84811d1113331d37bb17882f2c7792b2", "ja": "ワアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "3b4aa59e4b96e9d60286f5e804325b5d92c78f0f90d536ad9f9d0cc34f21b9d1", "ja": "クイズは、瑞希に負けちゃったんだけど。\nでも今の曲、すっごくイイ感じだったと思うよね！？", "zh": "虽然猜谜输给瑞希了，\n不过刚才那首歌，我觉得感觉特别棒，对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1006_audience", "source_sha256": "59b4beeeffdcb6ae11224e02c0358f7d84811d1113331d37bb17882f2c7792b2", "ja": "ワアアアアアア！！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "486dfc7bbb01b5140d39674dece9aece92b303d9112f595e987e2d2578265c5c", "ja": "ありがとー！　これからも、アタシはアタシなりに\nがんばるから！　応援、よろしくねーっ！", "zh": "谢谢大家——！今后我也会按自己的步调\n继续努力的！请大家多多支持哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1008_p", "source_sha256": "c0412fe98e2b0768ba85bf7438e895cf73ee96ed3f6b435d6e88cc1c25a79506", "ja": "（会場中に拍手と声援が響き渡る中、\n定期公演は無事、幕をおろした……）", "zh": "（会场中回荡着掌声与欢呼声，\n定期公演顺利地落下了帷幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "12a6f13ab2fe26ccb4f606077f61726c693cae7fa9b6daff14616ec79829d8ab", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nアタシ、決めたから！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n我已经决定了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1010_p", "source_sha256": "dd9a6ff0967f5daff080c65ae271b80216d9bc257a2d70f202b6a6743689b473", "ja": "のり子、お疲れさま。\n決めたって、いきなり何の話だ？", "zh": "德子，辛苦了。\n你说决定了，突然说的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "6dfd790e446ec2baab9ec29244d6615e9d3e4f80e2b4a5ef5a26ebecb7c513aa", "ja": "何って、目標の話だよ！\n公演には間に合わなかったけど……。", "zh": "说什么，当然是目标的事啦！\n虽然没能赶上公演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b76a8e25171924df6f549165b23cc4a9e4811dbc2cdde163fb0f1bd576148cde", "ja": "ああ、その事か。もしかして、何か決まったのか？", "zh": "啊，是那件事啊。难道说，已经决定好什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "a2073ec52f92f3b10491b1d7eac229e8bb3af60ee04848a600818d8508ea3561", "ja": "うん。アタシ、クイズも自分なりに本気でやってみて\n……結果は負けたけど、楽しかったんだよね。", "zh": "嗯。我也认真地用自己的方式挑战了猜谜……\n……虽然最后输了，但还是很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "77b6f2c72b19962472d9c460a4533661d6165167852c7cd122dee76f2d9eb774", "ja": "あ、今日のステージも、すごく楽しかった！", "zh": "啊，今天的舞台也特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1015_p", "source_sha256": "5c0ddadf6db5c9823c57341ec44a005647ce604add8ab30a631425e1d4096a8a", "ja": "そうか。そう思えたのは、\nのり子が本気でぶつかった証拠だな。", "zh": "这样啊。你会有这种感觉，正说明了法子是真心拼过来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "1b50775fd270ff2ca4d2d8cb9c0bb87df0953589cc9079f014e8a0f4632fb6a7", "ja": "うん！　だからアタシ、これからもいろんなことに\n挑戦したい！　また負けるかもしれないけど……。", "zh": "嗯！所以我今后也想挑战各种各样的事情！虽然可能还会再次输掉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "b0c8c2589e28f300a680d29534ece2fa0ee928360520578011eb7006090ea898", "ja": "負けても「楽しかった」なんて、やってみなきゃ\n絶対にわからなかったことだから。そうでしょ？", "zh": "就算输了还能说“很开心”，这种事不去试试就绝对不会明白。所以说，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1018_p", "source_sha256": "bf3d49355d9923e32a8756590ce72e9d20f8fdfb6876947703c340e296e81e63", "ja": "うん。そうだな。", "zh": "嗯。是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "7cfa9fe14762b934b68b055561146cb106bb5175ffcd7793a6bd779a68cb6c82", "ja": "だから、「まずは挑戦する」が、アタシの目標！\n……なんだけど。……どう、かな？", "zh": "所以，“先挑战看看”就是我的目标！\n……不过……你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1020_p", "source_sha256": "86114fb69075b011b3fd366810d0d882f06a018a8604422a939b794aa909a96c", "ja": "負けた時のために、プロデューサーがいる。\n俺はプロデューサーとして、とことん付き合うよ。", "zh": "为了应对失败，才有制作人在。作为制作人，我会陪你到底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1021_p", "source_sha256": "7e87e4e87b7077de76507d578e5d71b2aa2751ecc10c15ea8049fec6f1863c13", "ja": "いい目標ができたな、のり子！", "zh": "有了个好目标呢，法子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "452b4f51bc01aa9feef9b6679c52028e6ae39309d67ff68b9fea204ff8f446be", "ja": "{$P$}……へへっ♪\nありがとう！", "zh": "{$P$}……嘿嘿♪  \n谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1023_001har", "source_sha256": "b486f2033a22833b2503e0429282f74b27b2ad096efbf156c1cbea682a874fe6", "ja": "のり子ちゃん、お疲れさまー！\n新曲、すごく良かったね！", "zh": "纪子，辛苦啦——！\n新歌特别棒呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "69c7a0bc96f885f401a4e8fec082bea930921352736019662f0d8e71a8789eca", "ja": "はい。今日のステージで最も輝いていたのは、\n福田さんでした。……ライバルながら、あっぱれ。", "zh": "是的。今天的舞台上最耀眼的，是福田小姐。……虽然是对手，但确实令人佩服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "2fd3f2a1f07a70015fec676b4df072f86da9c242e75ded932ebe2a46e6825f46", "ja": "えっ、ほんとに！？　だったらうれしいな～、へへ。", "zh": "诶，真的吗！？那我可高兴了～嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1026_010azu", "source_sha256": "c87515373c30b17803c0c8c19fbf77d1dd8933b746401d2e04d18a09696e2ecf", "ja": "謙遜なんかしなくていいのよ。\nのり子ちゃんらしい、素敵なステージだったわ。", "zh": "不用谦虚啦。那是很有纪子风格的精彩舞台呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "de16e1377f24e80ee61671bd17e6373bf0f8507387dbe32a2a910fe01911e17b", "ja": "お客さんの反応も最高だったしね♪\n私も、楽しかったわ～。", "zh": "观众的反响也棒极了♪\n我也玩得很开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "faf0689eaf1151303950f26edb5eb9aaee5bd56e6f9f5a04df6f1c5c8d8e8081", "ja": "あずささん、莉緒姉も……。\nみんな楽しかったなんて、今日の公演は大成功だね！", "zh": "梓小姐、莉绪姐也……。\n大家都玩得很开心，今天的公演大获成功呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1029_p", "source_sha256": "20d17ccb3a0bc15afb5c52068680a311542cda18efbfd0b65363bee6765f2e3a", "ja": "みんなもお疲れさま。立ち話もなんだし、\n続きは着替えてからにしたらどうだ？", "zh": "大家也都辛苦了。站着聊也不是个事，\n不如等换完衣服再接着聊吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1030_001har", "source_sha256": "549c0a86be1d07aa37d029eafc8078e69b3dc7aa371629bc4fc32bbfcad5ae0f", "ja": "それもそうですね。みんな、着替えに行こうか！", "zh": "说得也是。大家，我们去换衣服吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "e98abf1627167553a9f0e3959bd73e65a76c3d1f98c7530a6a910b54d6d54f12", "ja": "それじゃ、アタシも着替えてこよっと。\n……あ、{$P$}！", "zh": "那么，我也去换衣服啦。\n……啊，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "be91dde9c5cfe7cefcd70d7e8a8ecc7ea6761f7eaa827bdea5d95bab26371e16", "ja": "アタシにこの曲をくれて、本当にありがとう！\nこれからもよろしくね！", "zh": "真的非常感谢你把这首歌交给我！\n今后也请多多关照啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1033_p", "source_sha256": "1b3aa15cd23f92c563f7c966599a415dae410d18605ddc4ce3bc83a0ea58dbb2", "ja": "（明るく元気だったり、時に自信がなかったり……\nそれもすべて、のり子らしさ、のり子の魅力だ）", "zh": "（时而开朗活泼，时而又缺乏自信……这些全都是法子独有的特点，也是法子的魅力所在。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_after_073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_073_1034_p", "source_sha256": "f550200587abc031f1a926278cc2bd9ff87ea6993d85b486d5288d8f9f56b13f", "ja": "（これからものり子は、様々な事に全力で挑む。その\n背中を、プロデューサーとして支え続けるだけだ！）", "zh": "（今后的法子也会全力挑战各种各样的事情。我只要作为制作人，继续支持她的背影就好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
